  "loader": "0x42b734 reads the whole file into buffer block 0x48b110 (getter 0x4015c5 / 0x4015da(off)); the exe addresses pieces by hard-coded offsets (exe_offsets), Mark.DEC is only the editor directory; Weather.e5 follows in the same block at +0x52f20",
